{"applicability_conditions":"用于EIS数据的等效电路拟合；当 0.5 < n < 1 时，CPE 表示非理想电容；当 n = 1 时，CPE 表示理想电容。CPE 用于表征非理想电容特性（电极表面孔隙、不均匀性和弛豫效应）。","identity":{"block_id":"b0045","equation_id":"equation_002","equation_number":"2","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\nZ _ {\\mathrm{CPE}} = \\frac {1}{Q (j \\omega) ^ {\\mathrm{n}}}\\tag{2}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.corsci.2025.113331"},"latex":"Z_{\\mathrm{CPE}} = \\frac{1}{Q (j \\omega)^{\\mathrm{n}}}","purpose":"定义等效电路中常相位角元件(CPE)的阻抗，用于替代理想电容以描述EIS中由电极表面孔隙、不均匀性和弛豫效应引起的非理想电容响应。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"常相位角元件(CPE)的阻抗","symbol":"Z_{\\mathrm{CPE}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"CPE 的导纳(admittance)","symbol":"Q","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"虚数单位(imaginary unit)","symbol":"j","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"角频率(angular frequency)","symbol":"\\omega","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"弥散指数(dispersion index)","symbol":"n","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["当 0.5 < n < 1 时，CPE 表示非理想电容；当 n = 1 时，CPE 表示理想电容。","Q 用于替代理想电容 C 以考虑非理想特性。","EIS 结果呈现两个时间常数的叠加，中频区最大相位角在 65° 与 75° 之间。"]}